    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Untold Story of Pandora\u2019s Box</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone knows the classic myth\u2014Pandora opened a box and unleashed misery upon the world. But few know the truth: who <i>really</i> appeared before her in Zeus\u2019 guise, what ancient terror escaped, how the Titan Iapetus broke free, and what price Greek heroes paid to stop Chaos\u2019 invasion. <strong>Epos Survivors</strong> lets you relive these events alongside legendary warriors. Slash through hordes of enemies, tackle diverse challenges solo or with friends, and survive endless waves of foes. Crush your enemies with expertly crafted dash effects, overpowered auto-attacks, carefully synergized autocast skills, and devastating overlock combos\u2014or dominate through seamless co-op play. The choice is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Satisfying Combat</strong> \u2013 Wreck endless waves of diverse enemies.<br>\u2714 <strong>Dynamic Campaign</strong> \u2013 Take on varied missions with unique objectives.<br>\u2714 <strong>Customizable Dash</strong> \u2013 Stack multiple effects for explosive movement.<br>\u2714 <strong>Autocast &amp; Synergies</strong> \u2013 Combine skills for powerful, game-changing builds.<br>\u2714 <strong>Solo or Co-op</strong> \u2013 Play alone or team up with friends for chaos-fueled battles.<br>\u2714 <strong>Unique Enemies</strong> \u2013 Face mythical beasts, steampunk constructs, and more\u2014each with distinct behaviors.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Untold Story of Pandora\u2019s Box</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone knows the classic myth\u2014Pandora opened a box and unleashed misery upon the world. But few know the truth: who <i>really</i> appeared before her in Zeus\u2019 guise, what ancient terror escaped, how the Titan Iapetus broke free, and what price Greek heroes paid to stop Chaos\u2019 invasion. <strong>Epos Survivors</strong> lets you relive these events alongside legendary warriors. Slash through hordes of enemies, tackle diverse challenges solo or with friends, and survive endless waves of foes. Crush your enemies with expertly crafted dash effects, overpowered auto-attacks, carefully synergized autocast skills, and devastating overlock combos\u2014or dominate through seamless co-op play. The choice is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Satisfying Combat</strong> \u2013 Wreck endless waves of diverse enemies.<br>\u2714 <strong>Dynamic Campaign</strong> \u2013 Take on varied missions with unique objectives.<br>\u2714 <strong>Customizable Dash</strong> \u2013 Stack multiple effects for explosive movement.<br>\u2714 <strong>Autocast &amp; Synergies</strong> \u2013 Combine skills for powerful, game-changing builds.<br>\u2714 <strong>Solo or Co-op</strong> \u2013 Play alone or team up with friends for chaos-fueled battles.<br>\u2714 <strong>Unique Enemies</strong> \u2013 Face mythical beasts, steampunk constructs, and more\u2014each with distinct behaviors.</p>",
